<title>CANADA: Canada dollar ends firmer on Liberal poll support.</title>
<headline>Canada dollar ends firmer on Liberal poll support.</headline>
<text>
<p>FORECAST RANGE   1.3760/1.3810	    ASIAN CLOSE     1.3790</p>
<p>RESISTANCE 1.3750   SUPPORT 1.3900	HI 1.3830   LO  1.3788</p>
<p>CANADA OPEN  1.3785/90    HI 1.3818     EUROPE OPEN     1.3785</p>
<p>PREV CLOSE   1.3823/28    LO 1.3770     HI 1.3796   LO  1.3786</p>
<p>---------------------MARKET COMMENT--------------------------</p>
<p>* Canada's dollar ended firmer on Thursday at C$1.3802 (US$0.7245) from Wednesday's close of C$1.3823 (US$0.7234) after polls indicated the ruling Liberals consolidating enough support to form a parliamentary majority.</p>
<p>* A Reuters poll showed support for the Liberals rebounding after a steady slippage in polls earlier this week.</p>
